From 20cff0d2eb3919fc7f0626bbcfe55a5711a2c231 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Easy Buy <122056680+Volttaik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 09:21:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Gate creator-profile content behind subscription and fix
 migration runner
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Creator profiles are subscriber-gated server-side: GET /creators/:id now
reports content_locked (false for the owner), and the posts/videos/shorts
content endpoints return locked:true with no rows to unsubscribed non-owners
(free content stays discoverable in Explore, not on the profile). Also split
the post_views migration into single statements so the libsql migration
runner can execute it.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
